---
import { consumptionGenerations, consumptionGen6 } from '../../data/consumptionEvolution';
---

<div class="comparison-table overflow-x-auto -mx-1">
  <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm min-w-[640px]">
    <thead>
      <tr class="border-b border-brass-mid/40">
        <th class="px-3 py-3 text-left font-medium text-text-soft uppercase tracking-wider text-xs w-24">代际</th>
        <th class="px-3 py-3 text-left font-medium text-text-soft uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">媒介</th>
        <th class="px-3 py-3 text-left font-medium text-text-soft uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">价值核心</th>
        <th class="px-3 py-3 text-left font-medium text-text-soft uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">决策方式</th>
        <th class="px-3 py-3 text-left font-medium text-text-soft uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">典型品牌</th>
        <th class="px-3 py-3 text-left font-medium text-text-soft uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">失效点</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {consumptionGenerations.map((g) => (
        <tr class="border-b border-brass-mid/15 row-brass">
          <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top cell-gen">
            <div class="text-brass-bright font-medium text-sm">{g.name}</div>
            <div class="text-brass-mid text-xs mt-0.5">{g.main}</div>
            <div class="text-brass-mid/80 text-xs mt-1 italic">{g.period}</div>
          </td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-cream leading-relaxed">{g.medium}</td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-cream leading-relaxed">{g.value}</td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-cream leading-relaxed">{g.decision}</td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-text-soft leading-relaxed italic">{g.brand}</td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-text-soft leading-relaxed">{g.failure}</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
      <tr class="row-coral border-y border-coral-deep/50">
        <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top cell-gen cell-gen--coral">
          <div class="text-coral-deep font-medium text-sm">{consumptionGen6.name}</div>
          <div class="text-coral-mid text-xs mt-0.5">{consumptionGen6.main}</div>
          <div class="text-coral-mid text-xs mt-1 italic">{consumptionGen6.period}</div>
        </td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-coral-deep leading-relaxed">{consumptionGen6.medium}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-coral-deep leading-relaxed">{consumptionGen6.value}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-coral-deep leading-relaxed">{consumptionGen6.decision}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-coral-mid leading-relaxed italic font-medium">{consumptionGen6.brand}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-coral-mid leading-relaxed">{consumptionGen6.failure}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p class="read-hint text-xs text-text-soft italic mt-4 p-4 bg-ink-elevated/60 rounded-sm leading-relaxed border-l border-brass-mid/30">
    <span class="text-cream font-medium not-italic">读法</span>
    · 第 1–5 代的「失效点」，正是下一代消费诞生的土壤。第 5 代的失效点（推送疲劳）= 第 6 代的诞生土壤（主动选择）。第 6 代的失效点尚未显形——但「规模化」是已可预见的挑战。
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .row-brass:hover {
    background: rgb(var(--rgb-ink-elevated) / 0.35);
  }

  .cell-gen {
    background: rgb(var(--rgb-brass-mid) / 0.08);
  }

  .row-coral {
    background: rgb(var(--rgb-ink-deep) / 0.5);
  }

  .cell-gen--coral {
    background: rgb(var(--rgb-brass-mid) / 0.04);
    box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--color-coral-deep);
  }
</style>
